# Synthetic fixture for SD-17 Slice B-5 equipment-modifier parser tests.
#
# The source path `equipmods_minimal.lst` contains the substring
# `equipmods`, which the parser uses to classify rows as
# `EquipmentRecordKind::EquipMod` rather than `Equip`.
#
# Both the directive-prefix form (`EQUIPMOD:<name>`) and the
# corpus-typical row form are exercised here.
#
# Line numbers are deterministic; tests assert on these exact lines.
# Field 1: SOURCELONG
# Field 2: SOURCESHORT
SOURCELONG:Synthetic Equipment Modifier Test Fixture	SOURCESHORT:SEMTF	SOURCEWEB:file:///tests/fixtures/lst/equipmods_minimal.lst	SOURCEDATE:2026-07-12

###Block: Directive-prefix equipment-modifier rows
EQUIPMOD:Material ~ Steel	KEY:Material ~ Steel	NAMEOPT:NOTHING	TYPE:BaseMaterial.Mundane.Armor.Weapon	COST:0	BONUS:ITEMCOST|TYPE.WEAPON|50
EQUIPMOD:Masterwork	KEY:Special Quality ~ Masterwork ~ Weapon	NAMEOPT:TEXT=Masterwork	TYPE:MasterworkQuality.Weapon	COST:0	BONUS:WEAPON|TOHIT|1|TYPE=Enhancement

###Block: Corpus-typical equipment-modifier rows (path contains equipmods)
Cloth	KEY:Material ~ Cloth	NAMEOPT:NOTHING	TYPE:BaseMaterial.Mundane.Ammunition.Armor.Shield.Weapon	COST:0	BONUS:ITEMCOST|TYPE.CLOTH|0	PREMULT:1,[PRETYPE:1,EQMOD=Material ~ Cloth]
Steel	KEY:Material ~ Steel	NAMEOPT:NOTHING	TYPE:BaseMaterial.Mundane.Ammunition.Armor.Shield.Weapon	COST:0	ITYPE:Metal	PREMULT:1,[PRETYPE:1,EQMOD=Material ~ Steel]

# A malformed EQUIPMOD row to exercise the diagnostic path.
EQUIPMOD:	KEY:MalformedEquipmodTest